codex
The symbolic loop claim now closes with `#Top`. The repair was a mathematically derived right-identity lemma for list concatenation (`A ++ [] = A`), needed only at the zero-remaining-iterations branch; the inductive branches execute the fixed body and reuse the circularity for arbitrary `I < len(VS)`. I’m moving to the whole-entry claim, which includes module loading, name binding, all three allocations, the exact function body, return/pop behavior, and the unbounded loop claim.
exec
